Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.36,0:01:30.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“它的使命完成了 卖掉或者吃掉吧”
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.16,0:01:32.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Not a chance.
