Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.72,0:03:48.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得它卡住了 是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.52,0:03:50.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] No, she wants, look, she's trying to get...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.52,0:03:50.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-它想…你看 它试着… -嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.28,0:03:52.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, she's stuck. Are you gonna go and help her?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.28,0:03:52.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 它卡住了 你要去帮它吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.32,0:03:53.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Just go and push her up, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.32,0:03:53.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-去帮它站起来 老兄 -你去？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.92,0:03:56.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Right, so all the lambs that have been born
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.92,0:03:56.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 所有小羊出生
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.00,0:03:58.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we haven't had to get involved in any of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.00,0:03:58.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们都没插手
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.28,0:04:02.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The first one I decide to have a look at and she needs a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.28,0:04:02.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我第一次想看看 就遇到要帮忙的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.08,0:04:03.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But she definitely does 'cause she's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.08,0:04:03.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但它确实需要帮忙 因为它…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.80,0:04:05.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Yeah, she's not getting up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.80,0:04:05.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 它站不起来 对…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.12,0:04:08.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[bleating] -[Jeremy] Oh no, there she is, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.12,0:04:08.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-不 它站起来了 而且… -起来了 刚才那下成了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.96,0:04:10.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Ooh! No, she's up. That did it. -That yellow one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.96,0:04:12.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那只黄色的 你看它多… 看起来有点紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.72,0:04:12.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That looks a bit stressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.36,0:04:15.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] Isn't yellow a sign of stress? -Yeah, stress. It's adrenalin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.36,0:04:15.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-黄色不是紧张的表现吗？ -对 是紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.00,0:04:17.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The first one comes flying out and the second one was a bit behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.00,0:04:17.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是肾上腺素 所以很明显 第一只很快就出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.88,0:04:20.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Ooh, only about three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.88,0:04:20.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第二只就慢了一点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.24,0:04:21.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Really? -[Jeremy] Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.24,0:04:21.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}也就晚了三分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.40,0:04:24.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Well. Look how easy that is though, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.40,0:04:22.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-真的？ -嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.32,0:04:24.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不过你看 多容易啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.52,0:04:25.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-See? -You do like these sheep, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.52,0:04:25.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-你看… -你确实喜欢这些羊 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.88,0:04:28.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is my type of lambing, lambing at a distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.88,0:04:28.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这才是我喜欢的产羔羊方式 远程产羔羊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.12,0:04:29.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy and Kaleb laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.44,0:04:32.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] But the lamb births were nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.44,0:04:32.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但这些羊羔的出生
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.56,0:04:35.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}compared to what was going on in the snail shed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.56,0:04:35.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}跟蜗牛棚里正在发生的事情比起来 根本不算什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.68,0:04:37.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Which had literally turned
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.68,0:04:37.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那里简直变成了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.88,0:04:42.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}into the set of a 1970s' porn film.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.88,0:04:42.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}1970年代的色情片片场
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.40,0:04:45.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[sensual soul music]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.68,0:05:05.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The rumpy-pumpy had been so prolific
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.68,0:05:05.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}交配太频繁了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.88,0:05:09.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that Lisa now had thousands of new-born snails
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.88,0:05:09.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在丽莎在塑料大棚里 做的那个“花园”中
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.84,0:05:13.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}living in the garden she'd created in one of the polytunnels.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.84,0:05:13.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}养了成千上万只新生的蜗牛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.64,0:05:16.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa] They are incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.64,0:05:16.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}太不可思议 就这样 白色的卵
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.48,0:05:22.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Just that, like, white egg and suddenly you got antennae, you've got shells.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.48,0:05:22.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后突然间就有了触角 有了壳
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.04,0:05:23.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You guys are amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.04,0:05:23.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.88,0:05:26.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You have grown well. You've grown beautifully.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.88,0:05:26.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们长得真好 真漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.40,0:05:30.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[folk music]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.20,0:05:31.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Meanwhile, out in the fields,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.20,0:05:31.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}与此同时 在田地里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.84,0:05:35.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb was doing some variable-rate fertilising
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.84,0:05:35.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布正在做变量施肥
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.20,0:05:39.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and positively swooning
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.20,0:05:39.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}并对我们全新的高科技作物管理系统
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.28,0:05:43.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}about our new hi-tech crop management systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.28,0:05:43.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}赞不绝口
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.16,0:05:46.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It tells me I'm putting 140 kg on a hectare.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.16,0:05:46.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它告诉我每公顷要施140公斤
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.00,0:05:48.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It fluctuates the whole thing for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.00,0:05:48.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它会自动调节所有东西
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.88,0:05:51.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}opening and shuts the thing as when needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.88,0:05:51.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}需要的时候就打开、关闭施肥口
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.36,0:05:52.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.36,0:05:52.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.28,0:05:57.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] And thanks to the wonders of my Mission Control centre,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.28,0:05:57.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}多亏了我那个神奇的任务控制中心
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.40,0:06:01.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I could boss him about from the comfort of my office chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.40,0:06:01.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我可以舒舒服服地 坐在办公椅上指挥他
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.04,0:06:03.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[clicking]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.56,0:06:05.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] I'm farming,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.56,0:06:05.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我现在的务农方式
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.28,0:06:09.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}in the same way those guys in Houston, in Apollo 13, were astronauts
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.28,0:06:09.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就像《阿波罗13号》里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.48,0:06:12.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}when they were sitting watching the astronauts at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.48,0:06:12.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}坐在休斯敦指挥中心 看着宇航员工作的那帮人一样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.72,0:06:13.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So here he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.72,0:06:13.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他现在在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.80,0:06:17.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is essentially the dashboard of his tractor
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.80,0:06:17.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他的拖拉机仪表盘
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.32,0:06:20.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}appearing on one of my screens.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.32,0:06:20.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}出现在我的屏幕上了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.36,0:06:21.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is where he is,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.36,0:06:25.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这就是他施氮肥时所在的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.92,0:06:25.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}as he applies the nitrogen fertiliser.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.92,0:06:27.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Er...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.92,0:06:31.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[over the radio] Flight Apollo Kaleb, this is Houston Control.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.92,0:06:31.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“飞行员”阿波罗卡莱布 这里是休斯顿控制中心
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.40,0:06:34.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Hello, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.40,0:06:34.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你好 哥们儿
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.88,0:06:36.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's not how astronauts talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.88,0:06:36.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}宇航员可不这么说话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.56,0:06:41.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, I have you at 140 kg per hectare
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.56,0:06:41.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 我这边的读数是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.92,0:06:43.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}on my readout here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.92,0:06:43.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}每公顷140公斤
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.52,0:06:45.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What, are you logged into my tractor?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.52,0:06:45.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}怎么 你登进我的拖拉机了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.04,0:06:47.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Certainly am.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.04,0:06:47.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当然
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.36,0:06:50.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I see you at 12 kilometres an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.36,0:06:50.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我看到你时速12公里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.36,0:06:53.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, I'm going 12K 'cause this field is the one that you ploughed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.36,0:06:53.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 我开12公里 因为这块地是你犁的 你…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.92,0:06:55.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The one that you fucked up, can you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.92,0:06:55.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就是你搞砸的那块 还记得吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.32,0:06:59.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's not how you address the head of Mission Control.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.32,0:06:59.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这不是跟任务控制中心主任 说话的方式
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.48,0:07:00.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I am Ed Harris.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.48,0:07:00.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我是艾德哈里斯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.36,0:07:03.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] You will have some respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.36,0:07:03.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}请你尊重一点
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.72,0:07:05.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Apologies, sir. Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.72,0:07:05.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}抱歉 先生 完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.28,0:07:08.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You don't have to say "apologies, sir."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.28,0:07:08.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不用说“抱歉 先生”
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.00,0:07:10.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Call me "Flight".
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.00,0:07:10.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}叫我“飞行控制中心”
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.20,0:07:12.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] That's what you call
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.20,0:07:12.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}《阿波罗13号》里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.20,0:07:14.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the man who sits in the white waistcoat in Apollo 13.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.20,0:07:14.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}穿白背心的那个人就是这么叫的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.80,0:07:18.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Apologies, "Flight". Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.80,0:07:18.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}抱歉 飞行控制中心 完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.44,0:07:20.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And you don't say "over".
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.44,0:07:20.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}也不用说“完毕”
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.56,0:07:23.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Course correction coming up in approximately 20,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.56,0:07:23.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}大约二十 也就是二零秒后
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.80,0:07:26.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that's two zero, seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.80,0:07:26.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}进行航线修正
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.76,0:07:28.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Course correction in approximately...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.76,0:07:30.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-航线修正大约在… -我他妈太爱这台机器了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.28,0:07:30.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] I fucking love this machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.24,0:07:31.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Jim Lovell never said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.24,0:07:32.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-吉姆洛弗尔从没说过这话 -你知道我意识到什么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.28,0:07:32.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb over radio] Actually, you know what I've just realised?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.52,0:07:34.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I actually love farming this way: you sat in that office,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.52,0:07:34.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我真的很喜欢这样务农
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.20,0:07:36.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm out here doing stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.20,0:07:36.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你坐在办公室里 我在外面干活
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.96,0:07:38.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}you're nowhere to be seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.96,0:07:38.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你人影都见不着
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.48,0:07:39.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] This is bliss!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.48,0:07:39.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}太幸福了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.44,0:07:43.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] He's forgotten to turn this side of his fert spreader on, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.44,0:07:43.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他忘了把施肥机的这一侧打开 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.56,0:07:45.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Please tell me he continues to forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.56,0:07:45.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}拜托他继续忘下去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.24,0:07:50.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look, he's got 150 going out one side; nothing going out the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.24,0:07:50.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看 他一边在撒150 另一边啥也没撒
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.68,0:07:54.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] You might wanna turn the left side of your fert spreader on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.68,0:07:54.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}兄弟 你可能要 把施肥机左边打开一下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.52,0:07:59.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, my left side's on. I'm about to put it on any second now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.52,0:07:59.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不用 我左边开着呢 我马上准备打开
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.24,0:08:00.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The right side you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.24,0:08:00.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你是说右边吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.48,0:08:02.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Good job I reminded you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.48,0:08:02.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}幸亏我提醒你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.24,0:08:08.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Mate, you're driving over a line you've already driven on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.24,0:08:08.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}兄弟 你现在开的那条线 之前已经开过了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.04,0:08:10.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I know, you fucking idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.04,0:08:10.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道 你个白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.80,0:08:12.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb whinging]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.96,0:08:14.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.96,0:08:14.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天哪！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.84,0:08:16.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Thank you, "Flight", over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.84,0:08:16.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}谢谢你 飞行控制中心 完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.68,0:08:18.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There you go, you see, he's getting the hang of it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.68,0:08:18.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看 他现在开始上手了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.28,0:08:22.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[soft music]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.56,0:08:25.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Sadly, on our new hi-tech farm,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.56,0:08:25.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}可惜的是 在我们这个高科技农场里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.64,0:08:28.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}one machine had been left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.64,0:08:28.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有一台机器被落下了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.28,0:08:33.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Thanks to its never-ending list of technical faults
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.28,0:08:33.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}由于它那没完没了的故障
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.80,0:08:36.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}coupled to the arrival of the AgBot,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.80,0:08:36.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}再加上农业机器人的到来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.84,0:08:40.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the green Lambo hadn't turned a wheel in weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.84,0:08:40.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那台绿色兰博基尼 已经好几周没动过了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.88,0:08:43.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, I decided to sell it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.88,0:08:43.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 我决定把它卖掉…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.72,0:08:46.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We have about 260 tractors there, machinery...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.72,0:08:46.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们这里大概有260台拖拉机 还有机械…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.12,0:08:47.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] 260? -Yeah, 260.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.12,0:08:47.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-260？ -对 260台
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.56,0:08:51.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Which meant getting it valued by an agricultural auctioneer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.56,0:08:51.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…所以得找个农机拍卖师给它估个价
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.28,0:08:55.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] It's a magnificent beast, as you can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.28,0:08:55.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}正如你看到的 它是一头雄伟的野兽
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.72,0:08:57.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How many hours has it done?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.72,0:08:57.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它跑了多少小时？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.24,0:09:00.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, I bought it at 3,150.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.24,0:09:00.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我买的时候是3150小时
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.40,0:09:03.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And I think it's now up to 3,300.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.40,0:09:03.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我想现在大概到3300小时了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.44,0:09:06.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, you know, it's a very low-mileage example.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.44,0:09:06.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-所以不算… -所以这台使用率很低
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.68,0:09:08.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Yes. -Erm...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.68,0:09:08.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.92,0:09:10.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Sat nav. -Sat nav.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.92,0:09:10.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-卫星导航 -卫星导航
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.36,0:09:11.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Trelleborg tyres.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.36,0:09:13.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}特瑞堡轮胎 当然还有空调
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.96,0:09:13.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Air con obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.48,0:09:16.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And if you wanna step in and have a look to see if there's anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.48,0:09:15.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你要想上去看看…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.36,0:09:17.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-好 我看看 -…看看有没有什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.36,0:09:19.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[auctioneer] Er, what can you tell me about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.36,0:09:19.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-能跟我说说它的情况吗？ -你想知道什么都行
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.72,0:09:20.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] I'll tell you anything you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.72,0:09:22.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-我发动一下不介意吧？ -不介意
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.88,0:09:22.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[auctioneer] Can I start it up? -Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.24,0:09:24.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[engine starting]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.84,0:09:27.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Smooth. Powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.84,0:09:27.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}平稳 有力
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.88,0:09:29.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[tractor beeping]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.88,0:09:29.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这边…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.12,0:09:30.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There's a... Erm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.52,0:09:31.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[beeping continues]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.72,0:09:34.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-There's a couple of lights on there. -Yeah, but they're minor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.72,0:09:33.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-这边有几个灯亮了 -它…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.76,0:09:34.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 但都是小问题
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.40,0:09:36.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[beeping] -[auctioneer] Service alarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.40,0:09:36.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“保养警报”
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.52,0:09:40.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Yeah, it's a small alarm that sometimes happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.52,0:09:40.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 有个…有时候会响个小警报
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.12,0:09:42.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[auctioneer] "Distributors not available".
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.12,0:09:42.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“分配器不可用”
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.12,0:09:44.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] What distributors?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.12,0:09:44.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}什么分配器？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.48,0:09:46.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[beeping]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.48,0:09:48.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 这是个新故障 “发动机警报 冷却液液位”
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.44,0:09:48.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[auctioneer] OK, that's a new one. Engine alarm coolant level.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.88,0:09:51.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[beeping continues] -[auctioneer] It's beeping a lot now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.88,0:09:51.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在警报有点多了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.08,0:09:53.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It could just be a loose wire and cost 15p.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.08,0:09:53.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}可能只是根线松了 花15便士就能修好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.08,0:09:56.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[engine stops]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.48,0:10:04.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, I'd be quite keen to hear what you think
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.48,0:10:05.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我很想听听你觉得它能卖多少钱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.24,0:10:05.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we'd get for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.40,0:10:07.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Not the easiest thing to sell in the world, I'll be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.40,0:10:07.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}说实话 这玩意儿不太好卖
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.88,0:10:12.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Er, but I would look somewhere in the region between 50 and 60 thousand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.88,0:10:12.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我觉得大概在五万到六万英镑之间
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.20,0:10:17.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hm...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.28,0:10:19.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[under his breath] Quite a lot less than I paid for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.28,0:10:19.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}比我买的时候可低了不少
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.44,0:10:23.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Why is it quite a lot less than I paid for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.44,0:10:23.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}为什么比我买的时候低那么多？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.32,0:10:25.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[softly] Erm, what did you pay for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.32,0:10:25.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你买的时候花了多少？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.20,0:10:27.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] Eighty. -OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.20,0:10:27.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-八万 -好的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.16,0:10:28.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And I thought that was a bargain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.16,0:10:28.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且我当时还觉得挺划算
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.60,0:10:30.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Did you? -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.60,0:10:30.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-你觉得？ -对
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.72,0:10:32.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm... we could achieve a bit more
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.72,0:10:32.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们也许能卖高一点 但我觉得还是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.96,0:10:35.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but I think we wanna set it at a reasonable level.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.96,0:10:35.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-定个合理的价位 -你打算定多少？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.52,0:10:37.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What would you set it at? Between 50 and 60...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.52,0:10:38.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-五万到六万跨度太大了 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.52,0:10:38.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Yeah. -It's quite a big gap.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.60,0:10:40.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, I would set it somewhere around 50 to be as competitive as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.60,0:10:40.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 我大概会定在五万左右
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.80,0:10:44.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-So not 60. 50? -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.80,0:10:43.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-这样竞争力尽可能强一些 -所以不是六万？五万？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.48,0:10:44.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.48,0:10:50.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Having done a pretty poor selling job on the auctioneer,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.48,0:10:50.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在跟拍卖师推销得相当失败之后
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.72,0:10:54.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I went to the pub to meet Nick the chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.72,0:10:54.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我去了酒吧见尼克大厨…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.52,0:10:56.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] I mean, I'm hoping it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.52,0:10:56.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我希望它能…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.28,0:10:59.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Because I wanted to host a dare night
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.28,0:10:59.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…因为我想办一个“勇气之夜”
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.76,0:11:04.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}where we'd serve food that people wouldn't normally want to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.76,0:11:04.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}专门供应人们平时不太想吃的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.52,0:11:09.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And initially, I did a pretty poor job of selling that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.52,0:11:09.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且一开始 我推销这个点子 也推销得相当失败
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.04,0:11:12.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There are issues with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.04,0:11:12.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这个事有些问题
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.56,0:11:14.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The main issue is that, like, the pub is busy,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.56,0:11:14.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}主要问题是 酒吧生意很好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.96,0:11:19.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}it serves 6 to 700 people a day, and it serves them with food that they like,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.96,0:11:16.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}每天要接待六百到七百人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.76,0:11:19.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}给他们供应的都是他们喜欢的食物
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.60,0:11:23.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and what you're proposing is that we'll serve fewer people
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.60,0:11:23.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而你提议我们用人们不喜欢的食物
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.44,0:11:25.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}with food that they don't like.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.44,0:11:25.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}去接待更少的人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.68,0:11:28.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-That's one way of looking at it. -Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.68,0:11:28.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}可以这么看
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.56,0:11:31.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's the way of looking at it. It's specifically what you want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.56,0:11:31.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就是这么看的 这正是你想做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.56,0:11:33.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Well, okay... -It can be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.56,0:11:33.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-好吧 我… -可以办
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.04,0:11:35.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It can be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.04,0:11:35.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}可以办
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.08,0:11:36.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-I really want to do it. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.08,0:11:36.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我真的很想办
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.20,0:11:38.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I really want to do it, 'cause I just think
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.20,0:11:40.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为我觉得这个国家 有太多食物被浪费了…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.24,0:11:40.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}there's a lot of food going to waste in this country...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.32,0:11:41.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And you are right, you are right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.32,0:11:41.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.40,0:11:43.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That needn't, that needn't go to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.40,0:11:43.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…而这些食物本不必被浪费
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.84,0:11:46.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And also, I think it's important
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.84,0:11:46.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且 我觉得这很重要
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.72,0:11:49.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}particularly in light of the fact
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.72,0:11:49.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}特别是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.56,0:11:52.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that meat prices are going through the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.56,0:11:52.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在肉价飞涨
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.28,0:11:53.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, a lot of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.28,0:11:53.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 很贵
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.72,0:11:57.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There are cuts of meat that are way cheaper than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.72,0:11:57.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有些部位的肉比那便宜得多
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.24,0:12:00.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And a lot of people are being forced into vegetarianism,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.24,0:12:00.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}很多人被迫吃素
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.04,0:12:04.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}erm, that don't need to be forced into something that awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.04,0:12:04.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但他们本不必被迫 去忍受那么可怕的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.56,0:12:07.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's definitely doable. Erm, I mean, we're gonna serve...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.56,0:12:07.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这绝对可行
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.20,0:12:09.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm, if it's a special event like Goose Night,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.20,0:12:09.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果是个特别的专场
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.48,0:12:13.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}then we'll probably have 120 seats max.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.48,0:12:13.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}比如像“鹅肉之夜”那样的 我们大概最多只能接待120个座位
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.04,0:12:15.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But can we just discuss the menu?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.04,0:12:15.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我们能不能先聊聊菜单？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.04,0:12:17.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Just tell me, what can we have?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.04,0:12:17.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你就告诉我 我们能做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.44,0:12:21.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, realistically, can you do tripe in milk and onions?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.44,0:12:21.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}说实在的 你能做牛奶洋葱炖牛肚吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.00,0:12:22.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We can do tripe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.00,0:12:22.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们能做牛肚
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.52,0:12:24.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Can you do sheep's heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.52,0:12:24.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你能做羊心吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.44,0:12:25.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We can do sheep's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.44,0:12:25.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们能做羊心
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.56,0:12:27.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Have you ever cooked pig's ears?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.56,0:12:27.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你做过猪耳朵吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.52,0:12:28.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.52,0:12:28.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}做过
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.44,0:12:30.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Snails, we've gotta do snails by the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.44,0:12:30.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对了 蜗牛 我们一定要做蜗牛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.48,0:12:33.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'cause we've now got quite a few of them at the farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.48,0:12:33.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为我们农场现在有很多
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.56,0:12:36.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We've just had 2,000 born.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.56,0:12:36.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们刚孵了两千只
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.08,0:12:37.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How is a snail born?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.08,0:12:37.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}蜗牛是怎么出生的？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.48,0:12:40.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They lay eggs. And the egg, it's quite extraordinary to watch,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.48,0:12:38.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-它们下蛋 -是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.80,0:12:40.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那个蛋 看起来特别神奇
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.96,0:12:44.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}this little white egg, like caviar...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.96,0:12:44.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就像鱼子酱一样的白色小蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.12,0:12:46.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hey, I tell you what, you can actually eat the eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.12,0:12:46.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嘿 我跟你说 那个蛋其实可以吃
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.00,0:12:48.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We could call it "snail caviar".
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.00,0:12:48.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们可以叫它蜗牛鱼子酱
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.80,0:12:52.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Yeah, a hundred percent. -So, snail caviar we're good on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.80,0:12:50.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 完全可以
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.36,0:12:52.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}蜗牛鱼子酱没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.76,0:12:56.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're looking at sheep's brains, is that a step too far for you or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.76,0:12:56.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看看羊脑 对你来说是不是有点过分了？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.04,0:12:57.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've never had sheep's brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.04,0:12:57.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我从来没吃过羊脑
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.76,0:12:59.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I wonder if you can take a sheep's brain out and it's still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.76,0:12:59.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我在想 你把羊脑取出来之后
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.76,0:13:02.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-The laws of animal welfare... -But you know what I mean, technically,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.76,0:13:02.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}羊还能活着吗？你懂我的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.32,0:13:04.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't think a sheep would notice that its brain's come out
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.32,0:13:04.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-动物福利方面是有法律的 -我觉得羊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.72,0:13:08.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}for a good month.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.72,0:13:08.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}大概一个月都不会 注意到自己的脑子没了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.60,0:13:10.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-So, brains... -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.60,0:13:10.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-所以 羊脑… -好的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.92,0:13:12.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Tripe and onions, snail caviar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.92,0:13:12.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…牛肚洋葱 蜗牛鱼子酱
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.04,0:13:14.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.04,0:13:14.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.24,0:13:15.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Could we do bat?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.24,0:13:15.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们能做蝙蝠吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.20,0:13:18.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Nick] Eating bats didn't see us well a few years ago, did they?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.20,0:13:18.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}前几年吃蝙蝠 可没给我们带来什么好处 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.60,0:13:20.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] True. That got bad PR...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.60,0:13:20.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那倒是 那东西名声太差了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.12,0:13:21.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[voices fading out]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.08,0:13:25.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[soft piano music]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.96,0:13:32.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] As the spring days ticked by,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.96,0:13:32.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}随着春日渐行渐远
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.16,0:13:35.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}our crops began to fill out nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.16,0:13:35.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们的庄稼开始长得有模有样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.20,0:13:38.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[soft music continues]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.28,0:13:45.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But over in the onion and beetroot field...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.28,0:13:45.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但在洋葱和甜菜地里…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.12,0:13:48.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Still the smartest field in the Cotswolds, this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.12,0:13:48.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这依然是科茨沃尔德最智能的一块地
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.32,0:13:49.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.32,0:13:49.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.24,0:13:52.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] The growth was a little harder to spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.24,0:13:52.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…作物的长势就没那么明显了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.60,0:13:54.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Charlie] Yeah, look, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.60,0:13:54.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 你们看 那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.76,0:13:56.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Oh, that little green thing? -[Charlie] Yeah, that's a weed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.76,0:13:56.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-什么 那点小绿苗？ -不 那是杂草
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.64,0:13:57.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Kaleb] Oh. -OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.64,0:13:57.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.80,0:14:01.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Charlie] There's the red beet, look, there it is. Can you see how small it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.80,0:14:00.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}红甜菜在那儿 你看 在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.00,0:14:01.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你能看出它有多小吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.24,0:14:02.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Kaleb] Oh, yeah! -[Jeremy] It's red.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.24,0:14:02.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-能 -它是红的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.96,0:14:04.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Charlie] There it is. -[Kaleb] It's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.96,0:14:04.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-在那儿 -它要出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.48,0:14:07.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's germinating. So it's coming out like that. It's unwrapping itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.48,0:14:07.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那在发芽 在往外冒 就这样出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.08,0:14:09.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] But it's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.08,0:14:08.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它在慢慢展开
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.20,0:14:09.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-但它长出来了 -什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.20,0:14:11.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Charlie] Yeah. So that's good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.20,0:14:11.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 所以是好消息
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.64,0:14:12.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] What about the onions?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.64,0:14:12.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}洋葱呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.80,0:14:15.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Charlie] Er, we have to go quite a long way for the onions.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.80,0:14:15.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们得走挺远才能看到…洋葱
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.20,0:14:17.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, I'm keen for that. I wanna see if the onions are taking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.20,0:14:17.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 我挺想看的 我想看看洋葱长没长出来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.40,0:14:19.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] I really want these to grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.40,0:14:20.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我真的很想让它们长起来 我想当奇平诺顿的洋葱王
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.40,0:14:21.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I want to be the onion king of Chipping Norton.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.92,0:14:24.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Look, the AgBot missed this bit of rolling here, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.92,0:14:24.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看 农业机器人漏了这一块没碾
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.28,0:14:26.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Charlie] No, no, no, that's the divide!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.28,0:14:26.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-什么？ -不 那是分界线
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.00,0:14:28.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Oh, that's the next one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.00,0:14:28.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-那是下一块了 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.60,0:14:31.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So he didn't miss it. Take it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.60,0:14:31.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我们就是… 所以它没漏 撤回那句话
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.12,0:14:32.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Charlie laughing] -[Kaleb] No, I'm not doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.12,0:14:32.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-不 我不撤回 -这样我们就知道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.52,0:14:36.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] That's how we know when the red onions start and the beetroots finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.52,0:14:36.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}红洋葱从哪里开始 而甜菜到哪里结束
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.96,0:14:40.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Charlie] Er... this is good news. I've found the onions.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.96,0:14:40.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好消息 我找到洋葱了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.24,0:14:42.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There it is, just there, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.24,0:14:42.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就在那儿 你看 那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.24,0:14:43.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] That? -[Charlie] That is an onion.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.24,0:14:43.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那个？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.16,0:14:47.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Charlie] I'm pleased with their start. -[Jeremy] OK, well, that's good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.16,0:14:45.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是一颗洋葱 我对它们的开局很满意
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.68,0:14:46.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 那是好消息
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.64,0:14:50.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] The only cloud on the horizon was that
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.64,0:14:50.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}唯一的不祥之兆是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.72,0:14:54.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}there weren't any clouds on the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.72,0:14:54.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天边没有任何云彩
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.68,0:14:59.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Weeks had passed since it had last rained.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.68,0:14:59.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}已经好几个星期没下雨了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.88,0:15:02.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But Charlie wasn't overly worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.88,0:15:02.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但查理并不太担心
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.20,0:15:05.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm, it cools down next week a bit
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.20,0:15:05.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}下周会凉快一点 然后希望
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.56,0:15:07.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and then we hopefully get some rain in the next couple of weeks
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.56,0:15:07.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}接下来几周能下点雨 庄稼就会继续长
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.76,0:15:09.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-and it will just keep growing. -So you reckon,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.76,0:15:11.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以你估计…你就跟我说个大概… 我喜欢有个具体日期和时间
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.00,0:15:11.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}just give me a time. You know I like a date and a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.72,0:15:13.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}When do we have to have some rain by?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.72,0:15:13.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们最晚什么时候必须下雨？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.56,0:15:16.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This will be all right for two or three weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.56,0:15:16.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}再撑两三个星期没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.56,0:15:17.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Oh will it? -I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.56,0:15:17.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-能行吗？ -我觉得能行
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.84,0:15:19.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because it's gonna cool down next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.84,0:15:19.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为下周会凉快下来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.40,0:15:23.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[folk music]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.44,0:15:26.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] There was obviously a bit of moisture in the soil
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.44,0:15:26.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}土壤里显然还有点水分
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.68,0:15:30.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because a few days later, some weeds began to appear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.68,0:15:30.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为几天后 杂草开始冒出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.04,0:15:36.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But these were quickly dealt with by the Droid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.04,0:15:36.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但这些很快就被播种机器人解决了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.64,0:15:43.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}A process that Kaleb found absolutely fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.64,0:15:43.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布觉得这个过程特别有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.24,0:15:46.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[engine whirring over the speakers]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.96,0:15:54.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Me, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.96,0:15:54.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.76,0:15:56.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I was looking for something to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.76,0:15:56.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我当时正在找事做
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.88,0:15:58.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.88,0:15:59.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嘿 过来看看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.28,0:15:59.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come and have a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.64,0:16:06.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So I've just been on the government's website, the government's,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.64,0:16:06.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我刚才上了政府的网站 是政府官网
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.64,0:16:10.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and it said... there's a whole thing here on large, leaky, wooden dams.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.64,0:16:10.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}上面说…有整整一个 关于大型渗水木坝的内容
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.72,0:16:12.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Woody dams, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.72,0:16:12.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“木质堤坝” 明白吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.88,0:16:16.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So it says it slows the movement of water,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.88,0:16:16.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}上面说 “它能减缓水流速度 储存水分
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.00,0:16:18.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}stores water, stops flooding downstream.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.00,0:16:18.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-防止下游洪水泛滥” -对
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.28,0:16:19.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Yeah. -Blah, blah, blah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.96,0:16:22.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And they're prepared to pay for us to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.96,0:16:22.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且他们愿意付钱让我们来建
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.52,0:16:23.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-They pay us to do it? -[Jeremy] They pay us
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.52,0:16:23.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们付钱让我们干？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.64,0:16:26.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to slow the water down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.64,0:16:26.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们付钱让我们减缓水流速度
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.04,0:16:28.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How much?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.04,0:16:28.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}给多少？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.48,0:16:30.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, that's why I've called you over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.48,0:16:30.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这就是我叫你过来的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.68,0:16:35.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}£764.42 for each dam?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.68,0:16:35.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}每座堤坝764.42英镑？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.36,0:16:38.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. They're thinking we'll be like human beavers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.36,0:16:38.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 他们是想让我们当人类版的海狸
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.24,0:16:43.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Beavers don't make completely watertight Hoover dams, do they?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.24,0:16:43.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}海狸建的坝 也不是完全不透水的 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.32,0:16:46.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-No, they just slow the water down. -They just slow the water down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.32,0:16:46.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-它们只是减缓水流 -它们只是减缓水流
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.20,0:16:50.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All we need to do: go down there, just lob a few of those logs in the stream.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.20,0:16:47.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们只需要去那边
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.88,0:16:49.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把几根木头
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.40,0:16:50.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-往溪里一扔 -好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.48,0:16:53.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Lob them in in a sort of arrangement. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.48,0:16:53.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}按某种排列方式扔进去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.04,0:16:56.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It helps delay the passage of floodwater downstream,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.04,0:16:54.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.08,0:16:56.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“它有助于减缓洪水下泄速度”
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.96,0:16:59.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}allows sediment to settle out
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.96,0:16:59.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-对 -“使沉积物沉淀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.84,0:17:02.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and reduces downstream flood risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.84,0:17:02.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}降低下游洪水风险”
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.20,0:17:04.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Let's go and do it. -We'll go and do it! It's 700.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.20,0:17:04.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-我们去干吧 -我们这就去干！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.08,0:17:07.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I can send Starmer a bill this afternoon for 750...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.08,0:17:07.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}七百…我下午就能给斯塔默开账单
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.16,0:17:09.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, no, no, 7,000, 'cause we'll build ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.16,0:17:09.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-750… -不 七千
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.32,0:17:11.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, we'll build ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.32,0:17:11.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-我们建十座 -我们建十座
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.08,0:17:12.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}As I've been saying for a long time,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.08,0:17:12.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我早就说过
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.00,0:17:14.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}this Labour government, bloody good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.00,0:17:14.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这届工党政府 真是好样的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.88,0:17:18.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Bloody good. Well done, Starmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.88,0:17:18.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好样的 干得好 斯塔默
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.68,0:17:22.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[epic music]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.76,0:17:25.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] The next morning, Kaleb and I headed off
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.76,0:17:25.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第二天早上 卡莱布和我出发去一条小溪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.88,0:17:30.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to one of the streams in what was the first proper outing
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.88,0:17:30.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这也是我那辆漂亮的新多功能越野车
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.40,0:17:32.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}for my snazzy new UTV.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.40,0:17:32.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第一次正式出任务
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.68,0:17:33.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[branches snapping]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.84,0:17:35.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[epic music continues]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.80,0:17:37.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] "Hill Descent" on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.80,0:17:37.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}陡坡缓降开启
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.28,0:17:39.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] I must admit, it's very comfortable in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.28,0:17:39.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我必须承认 这里面坐着真舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.96,0:17:45.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] At the stream, we found the makings of a dam
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.96,0:17:45.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}到了小溪边 我们发现大自然
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.92,0:17:48.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that nature had already started
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.92,0:17:48.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}已经打好了一个堤坝的基础
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.88,0:17:52.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and identified some branches and shrubbery
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.88,0:17:54.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还找到了一些 可以用来加固的树枝和灌木
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.04,0:17:54.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that we could use to improve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.88,0:17:56.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Right, so my plan is,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.88,0:17:59.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 我的计划是 如果把上游那些东西清理掉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.68,0:17:59.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}if we clear away that stuff up there,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.88,0:18:02.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the flotsam and jetsam will come down here,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.88,0:18:02.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那些漂浮物就会流下来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.64,0:18:05.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}wedge against what's already here,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.64,0:18:05.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡在已有的这些东西上…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.08,0:18:06.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but nature builds it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.08,0:18:06.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-对… -…但这是大自然建的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.80,0:18:09.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Kaleb] Yeah. -[Jeremy] A leaky woody dam.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.80,0:18:09.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-对 -一座渗水的木坝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.80,0:18:14.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] There was, however, one serious sticking point.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.80,0:18:14.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不过 有一个严重的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.60,0:18:17.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm just loathe to do this, unless Amazon have sent
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.60,0:18:17.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我真不想干这个 除非亚马逊派个专业的潜水员来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.48,0:18:20.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}some trained divers to rescue us in case we drown.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.48,0:18:20.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}以防我们淹死
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.72,0:18:22.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Yeah, that's a big puddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.72,0:18:22.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 这水挺深的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.72,0:18:27.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, thank God, we've got them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.72,0:18:27.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}谢天谢地 我们有潜水员
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.28,0:18:29.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Did you hear that Amazon Health and Safety...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.28,0:18:29.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你听见了吗 亚马逊健康安全部门…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.92,0:18:32.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Are you by a stream?" Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.92,0:18:32.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“你们是在小溪边吗？”对
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.00,0:18:34.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"You have to have trained divers."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.00,0:18:34.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“你们必须有专业潜水员在场”
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.84,0:18:37.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}To be fair, it's probably a good idea 'cause if you fell over in there,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.84,0:18:37.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}说真的 这可能是个好主意 你要是掉进去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.20,0:18:39.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-I couldn't save you. it's too deep. -[Jeremy] I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.20,0:18:38.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我可救不了你 水太深了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.96,0:18:40.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.12,0:18:41.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Knowing we were now safe,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.12,0:18:43.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}知道我们现在安全 我们就可以开工了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.96,0:18:43.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we could get cracking,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.64,0:18:48.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}hacking into all the shrubbery and foliage upstream,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.64,0:18:48.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}砍掉上游所有灌木和杂草
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.20,0:18:50.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which meant bringing back
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.20,0:18:50.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这就意味着
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.08,0:18:53.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the Diddly Squat machine of devastation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.08,0:18:53.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}要请出迪丽斯库阿特的毁灭机器
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.08,0:18:56.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[epic music]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.52,0:18:57.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Engaging rotors.
