Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.12,0:19:07.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[crashing] -[Jeremy] Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.12,0:19:07.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.16,0:19:12.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Observe the path being created.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.16,0:19:12.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看那条路被开辟出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.56,0:19:13.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[crashing]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.80,0:19:15.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[epic music continues]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.80,0:19:19.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Once the RoboMulcher had daintily made its way
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.80,0:19:20.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}等碎木机灵巧地开到了水边…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.12,0:19:20.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}down to the water...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.72,0:19:23.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] He's in!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.72,0:19:23.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它进去了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.80,0:19:26.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] It got straight to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.80,0:19:26.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…它立刻就开工了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.68,0:19:30.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[epic music continues]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.80,0:19:34.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Ohoo-yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.80,0:19:34.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好样的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.16,0:19:40.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Mince!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.16,0:19:40.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}全都碾碎！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.20,0:19:44.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Mince on toast!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.20,0:19:44.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}碎得跟肉酱一样！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.12,0:19:46.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.12,0:19:46.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.20,0:19:50.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I was very rude about this in the last series
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.20,0:19:50.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我上一季还吐槽它
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.24,0:19:53.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and said it was my second favourite machine on earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.24,0:19:53.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}说它只是我在地球上第二喜欢的机器
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.44,0:19:55.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I was wrong. It's back at number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.44,0:19:55.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我错了 它重回第一
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.84,0:19:57.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[crashing]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.80,0:20:03.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Lisa] Hey, K. -[Kaleb] Hello, Lisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.80,0:20:03.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-嘿 老卡 -你好 丽莎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.76,0:20:07.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Right, let's just have a quick look at what we've achieved here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.76,0:20:07.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 我们快速看一下 我们取得了什么成果
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.48,0:20:11.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So all this flotsam is gonna wash away
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.48,0:20:11.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所有这些漂浮物都会被冲走
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.72,0:20:15.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and jam up in that beavery type dam there,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.72,0:20:15.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后卡在那个像海狸坝一样的东西上
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.28,0:20:17.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and that's creating a slow-moving bit
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.28,0:20:19.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这样就形成了一片缓流区 这正是我们想要达到的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.32,0:20:19.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which is what you want to try and achieve.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.68,0:20:24.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] While the said flotsam made its way downstream,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.68,0:20:24.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那些漂浮物正往下游漂去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.32,0:20:26.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I set about clearing some branches
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.32,0:20:26.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我开始用另一件神奇的工具
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.60,0:20:30.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}with yet another tool of wonderment.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.60,0:20:30.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}清理一些树枝
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.04,0:20:31.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[whirring]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.04,0:20:36.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, Jesus fucking Christ!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.04,0:20:36.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.76,0:20:39.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.76,0:20:39.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-你看见了吗？ -看见了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.52,0:20:41.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ogh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.20,0:20:46.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] With the pesky branches cleared away,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.20,0:20:46.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}烦人的树枝清理干净后
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.84,0:20:50.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we then had to remove a fallen tree,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.84,0:20:50.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们还得把一棵倒下的树弄走…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.76,0:20:55.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which meant I could try out my new UTV's winch.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.76,0:20:55.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这意味着我可以试试 我的新多功能越野车的绞盘
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.72,0:20:56.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Keep going, keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.72,0:20:56.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}继续
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.08,0:21:00.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] OK? Tree removal unit...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.08,0:21:00.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 移树小组
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.12,0:21:03.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[wood cracking]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.92,0:21:07.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Bleeding Ada,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.92,0:21:07.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天哪 你看这大小…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.12,0:21:09.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}look at the size of this, a big old tree coming out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.12,0:21:09.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这棵又大又老的树要被拉出来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.56,0:21:13.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Keep coming a little bit more, keep coming, keep coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.56,0:21:13.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}再来一点 再来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.68,0:21:18.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Whoa! That'll do perfect there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.68,0:21:18.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那儿正合适
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.40,0:21:27.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa] That machine is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.40,0:21:27.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那机器太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.40,0:21:30.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] The last job was to chop the tree up
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.40,0:21:33.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}最后一项工作是把那棵树劈开 做成更大的木头用来筑坝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.64,0:21:32.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to make some bigger logs for the dam.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.44,0:21:37.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And by the close of play, we were better off
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.44,0:21:37.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}收工的时候 我们赚了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.96,0:21:43.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to the tune of 764 pounds and 42 pence.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.96,0:21:43.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}764.42英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.16,0:21:47.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] OK, all right, let's go back for tea and medals.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.16,0:21:47.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 行了 我们回去喝茶领奖章吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.04,0:21:49.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do you know what we're actually making accidentally?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.04,0:21:49.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道我们其实在做什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.00,0:21:52.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}A really good pooh-sticks river.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.00,0:21:50.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}无意中？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.68,0:21:52.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一条特别好的“维尼棒”河
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.80,0:21:54.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.80,0:21:54.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.80,0:21:58.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Oh, for fuck's sake. -[chuckling]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.80,0:21:58.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我服了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.92,0:22:03.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[soft folk music]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.64,0:22:09.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] The next morning, as we set off to build a second dam,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.64,0:22:09.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第二天早上 我们去建第二座堤坝时
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.20,0:22:11.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we had two passengers
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.20,0:22:14.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们多了两个乘客 它们比我还喜欢那辆多功能越野车
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.24,0:22:14.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}who loved the UTV even more than I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.20,0:22:16.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hello, dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.20,0:22:17.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你好 狗狗 艾莉亚？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.92,0:22:17.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Arya?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.48,0:22:20.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy and Kaleb laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.96,0:22:23.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They'd had it... You know I told you at the weekend,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.96,0:22:23.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们已经…我跟你说过 周末
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.76,0:22:25.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I took them out in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.76,0:22:25.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我带它们坐这个出去
