Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.32,0:22:28.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把它们弄下车 它们又立刻跳了回去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.04,0:22:30.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-and refused to get out of it. -Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.04,0:22:30.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-而且不肯下来 -为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.36,0:22:33.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-They liked it so much. -They just love going along in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.36,0:22:32.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-它们就是喜欢… -它们太喜欢了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.00,0:22:33.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们就是喜欢坐这车兜风
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.28,0:22:38.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] First of all, we had to load up with some logs
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.28,0:22:38.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}首先 我们得装一些木头
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.72,0:22:41.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which we'd use to make dam number two.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.72,0:22:41.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}用来建第二座堤坝
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.92,0:22:46.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Best day ever. Come on, out you come.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.92,0:22:46.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}最棒的一天？来吧 你们下来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.84,0:22:48.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Out you come. Come on. Good dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.84,0:22:48.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}下来 来吧 好狗狗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.84,0:22:51.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] You wanna put this one in? It's quite a nice one to lay in, innit?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.84,0:22:51.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你想把这块放进去吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.04,0:22:53.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] Look. -Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.04,0:22:53.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-这个放进去挺不错的 对吧？ -你看
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.08,0:22:55.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Out. Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.08,0:22:55.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}下来 出来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.84,0:22:57.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Arya. No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.84,0:22:57.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}艾莉亚？不…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.76,0:23:01.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Arya, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.76,0:23:01.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}艾莉亚 过来
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.36,0:23:03.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come here, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.36,0:23:03.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}过来
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.88,0:23:10.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Fungus, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.88,0:23:10.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是真菌
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.28,0:23:13.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy chuckling] Oh, fuck...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.28,0:23:13.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我靠…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.72,0:23:17.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What are we going to do about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.72,0:23:17.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这我们怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.80,0:23:19.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Sansa, Arya, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.80,0:23:19.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}珊莎、艾莉亚 过来
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.36,0:23:21.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.36,0:23:22.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}过来 现在 待着
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.84,0:23:22.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Now stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.92,0:23:28.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Having loaded up the logs, we headed off to our next dam site.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.92,0:23:28.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}装好木头后 我们就出发去下一个坝址了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.84,0:23:33.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] This is fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.84,0:23:33.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}真有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.80,0:23:37.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}£764 is what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.80,0:23:37.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它值764英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.08,0:23:41.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Charlie] Hello. -Charlie Ireland!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.08,0:23:40.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.12,0:23:41.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}查理爱尔兰！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.60,0:23:43.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.60,0:23:43.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还好吗？
