Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.80,0:23:46.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们在筑坝？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.20,0:23:50.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, we're building specifically a leaky woody dam. Excuse me.
