Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.60,0:46:03.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The yellowy one is 7 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.60,0:46:03.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}黄的那份七百万
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.20,0:46:05.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The sort of reddy one in the middle is 9.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.20,0:46:05.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}中间那种有点红的是九百万
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.80,0:46:09.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Seven million, as I say, is very very very hot,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.80,0:46:09.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}七百万 如我所说 非常非常非常辣
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.40,0:46:11.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}hotter than anything you will have ever tasted.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.40,0:46:11.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}比你们尝过的任何东西都辣
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.80,0:46:14.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Nine: way hotter than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.80,0:46:14.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}九百万 比那还辣得多
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.20,0:46:17.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Fifteen: a speck.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.20,0:46:17.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一千五百万 一点点就行
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.80,0:46:19.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Thank you kindly.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.80,0:46:19.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}谢谢 太客气了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.84,0:46:22.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] The diners took the plunge.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.84,0:46:22.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}食客们勇敢尝试了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.60,0:46:28.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.60,0:46:28.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.84,0:46:33.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[diners coughing and laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.72,0:46:35.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.72,0:46:35.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我犯了个大错
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.92,0:46:40.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[man] I'll tell you what, that...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.92,0:46:40.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}水
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.60,0:46:45.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[laughing and chatting]
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.40,0:46:46.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Are you OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.40,0:46:46.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.32,0:46:51.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[man] There was the tiniest, the tiniest bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.36,0:46:54.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb screaming]
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.64,0:46:55.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Charlie laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.28,0:46:57.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Charlie] Oh, that's pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.28,0:46:57.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.60,0:47:00.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[diners laughing and coughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.08,0:47:05.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] As one of the guests deposited his cleansed palate
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.08,0:47:05.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有位客人把清完口的食物
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.52,0:47:09.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}along with quite a lot of squirrel into our flowerbeds...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.52,0:47:09.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}连同不少松鼠 一起吐进了我们的花坛里…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.52,0:47:11.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[man retching and vomiting]
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.84,0:47:15.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] We had a chat on our table about what we'd learned.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.84,0:47:15.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们在桌上聊了聊今晚的收获
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.44,0:47:20.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm just thinking, is there one thing from tonight we could put on the menu?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.44,0:47:17.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我只是在想 有没有一样…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.56,0:47:20.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有没有今晚的哪道菜可以加进菜单？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.16,0:47:21.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Lisa] No. -Pig's ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.16,0:47:21.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-不可能 -猪耳朵
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.40,0:47:22.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The feedback from people was...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.40,0:47:22.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}大家的反馈是…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.68,0:47:24.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The pig's ears? The feedback...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.68,0:47:24.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-猪耳朵？ -对
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.20,0:47:25.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I prefer them over pork scratchings.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.20,0:47:25.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}比起猪皮脆 我更爱吃这个
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.96,0:47:28.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Snails. Snails are a winner. -[Lisa] Charlie, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.96,0:47:27.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}蜗牛 蜗牛肯定能上
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.80,0:47:28.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}查理 不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.88,0:47:31.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Snails were really popular. So we just need more snails.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.88,0:47:31.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}蜗牛真的很受欢迎
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.00,0:47:33.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa] Stay away from the snails.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.00,0:47:33.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-所以我们只需要更多蜗牛 -离蜗牛远点
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.36,0:47:35.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, forget your hand cream, let's just eat them.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.36,0:47:35.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 忘了你的护手霜 我们还是把它们吃掉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.40,0:47:39.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, listen, it was a fun night and it was good for the pub.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.40,0:47:39.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}听我说 今晚很有趣 对酒吧也有好处
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.72,0:47:44.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] We only killed six people so that's not bad at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.72,0:47:44.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们只干掉了六个人 所以还算不错
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.88,0:47:46.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[man retching]
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.88,0:47:52.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Dare Night was one of those wonderful, carefree moments
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.88,0:47:52.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“勇气之夜”是过去几周里
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.00,0:47:55.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that had peppered our lives over the last few weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.00,0:47:55.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}点缀我们生活的 那种美妙又无忧无虑的时刻之一
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.12,0:48:00.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We'd welcomed some new additions...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.12,0:48:00.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们迎来了一些新成员…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.12,0:48:04.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Ah... -Ah! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.12,0:48:04.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嘿？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.96,0:48:07.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Taken our farm into the next century...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.96,0:48:07.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…把我们的农场带进了下一个世纪…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.20,0:48:11.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The Starship Enterprise has just landed at Diddly Squat.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.20,0:48:11.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…进取号星舰 刚刚降落在迪丽斯库阿特
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.60,0:48:16.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] And generally revelled in being on the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.60,0:48:16.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…总的来说 我们尽情享受着 在这片土地上的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.12,0:48:16.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[goats bleating]
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.12,0:48:18.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[soft music]
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.76,0:48:21.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Look at that sight. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.76,0:48:21.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看看那景象 来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.00,0:48:27.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] But at the beginning of May, it started to become clear...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.00,0:48:27.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但五月初 情况开始变得明朗…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.72,0:48:32.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that trouble was brewing.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.72,0:48:32.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}麻烦正在酝酿
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.08,0:48:34.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[radio journalist] So, dry start to spring,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.88,0:48:38.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the driest since 1956, and concerns there could be a drought this summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.72,0:48:41.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Farmers are reporting their crops are struggling
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.16,0:48:44.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}after March and April saw only half the usual rainfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.80,0:48:46.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Let's go to Harry Metcalfe first, a farmer...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.36,0:48:50.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[soft melancholic music]
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.20,0:48:54.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Three weeks ago, Charlie had said we needed some rain
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.20,0:48:54.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}三周前 查理说过
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.64,0:48:58.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}in the next three weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.64,0:48:58.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们在接下来三周内需要一些雨水
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.40,0:49:04.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That time had now passed without so much as a drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.40,0:49:04.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在期限已过 一滴雨都没下…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.80,0:49:07.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[wind blowing]
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.44,0:49:10.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Charlie] If we go 30 yards this way...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.44,0:49:10.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果我们往这边走三十码…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.40,0:49:13.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] And the crops were starting to struggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.40,0:49:13.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…庄稼已经开始撑不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.52,0:49:16.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look, you see what the weather's doing? You see how that flag leaf is closed?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.52,0:49:16.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看天气造成的影响了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.20,0:49:18.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] The flag leaf is this one? -[Charlie] Yes, correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.20,0:49:18.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看到那片旗叶是怎么卷起来的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.40,0:49:23.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] That's curling round because the moisture it's got, it protects it
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.40,0:49:20.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-旗叶是这片吗？ -对 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.56,0:49:23.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它卷起来是为了保住仅有的一点水分
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.32,0:49:25.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-from the wind and the sunshine? -[Charlie] Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.32,0:49:25.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-保护自己免受风吹日晒？ -对 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.12,0:49:28.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] You can actually see that the leaf is curling round.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.12,0:49:28.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你能真切地看到叶子在卷曲
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.56,0:49:29.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Charlie] Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.56,0:49:29.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.52,0:49:33.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] And then the yellow at the top is telling me it's under stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.52,0:49:33.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后顶部的黄色告诉我 它正在受压
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.68,0:49:35.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Charlie] Yeah. Other ones down here, like that one,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.68,0:49:35.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 下面这些
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.80,0:49:37.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}they're shrivelled, so they've given up.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.80,0:49:37.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}像那棵已经枯了 所以已经不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.92,0:49:39.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] Hold on, I've got this one. -That's a brilliant example.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.92,0:49:39.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}等等 我这儿有一株 所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.44,0:49:41.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Charlie] You've got one. -That's just died.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.44,0:49:41.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 你看 这就是个绝佳的例子
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.32,0:49:44.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, OK, we put one seed in the ground...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.32,0:49:44.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它已经死了 所以 好的 这是一棵…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.16,0:49:46.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.16,0:49:46.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-我们往土里播了一颗种子… -对
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.72,0:49:49.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] And it was going to produce three of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.72,0:49:48.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它本该长出三个
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.20,0:49:49.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-这样的穗 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.48,0:49:53.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But because it didn't rain, that one and that one have died.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.48,0:49:53.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但因为没下雨 这两根都死了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.52,0:49:54.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Charlie] Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.52,0:49:54.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.44,0:49:56.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] You know Harry Metcalfe, Harry's Farm?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.44,0:49:56.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你认识哈里梅特卡夫 哈里农场？ 他做油管频道的 特别厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.76,0:49:58.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He does a YouTube channel.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.76,0:49:59.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-对 -对 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.32,0:49:59.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-He's brilliant. -[Charlie] Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.84,0:50:02.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] He was saying because of this,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.84,0:50:02.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他说 正因为这样
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.08,0:50:05.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we're losing as a country, the UK,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.08,0:50:05.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-我们整个英国 整个联合王国… -对
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.24,0:50:10.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}100,000 tonnes of just wheat, not barley, just wheat, a day,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.24,0:50:10.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…每天要损失十万吨小麦 只是小麦 不包括大麦 每天如此
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.20,0:50:13.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and have been for a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.20,0:50:13.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且已经持续一个月了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.96,0:50:16.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And the other thing about it, it's so short.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.96,0:50:16.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还有一件事 这麦秆太短了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.92,0:50:18.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.92,0:50:18.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.20,0:50:20.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Charlie] There's gonna be no straw. -That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.20,0:50:19.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不会再有麦秆了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.60,0:50:20.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}确实
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.40,0:50:22.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There'll be no bread or straw.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.40,0:50:22.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不会有面包 也不会有麦秆
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.04,0:50:25.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Charlie] No. Nothing for the cattle to sit on.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.04,0:50:25.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没有 牛也没东西可趴了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.72,0:50:28.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] We do need for it to rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.72,0:50:28.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们确实需要下雨了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.20,0:50:32.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[soft music]
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.12,0:50:34.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] The days rolled on
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.12,0:50:38.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}日子一天天过去 天空依然万里无云
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.56,0:50:38.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but the skies remained resolutely cloudless.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.64,0:50:43.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Kaleb] It looks like a fucking desert. -[Jeremy] I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.64,0:50:43.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}外面看起来像沙漠一样 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.40,0:50:46.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I came up here the other day, I thought we were growing stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.40,0:50:46.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道 我前几天来这儿 还以为我们在种石头呢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.80,0:50:48.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb laughing] Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.80,0:50:48.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.08,0:50:50.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] But all that effort we went to with that field and then God went,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.08,0:50:50.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我们为那块地费了那么大劲
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.04,0:50:52.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"And you're having, er, no rain."
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.04,0:50:52.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}结果上帝却说 “你们就别想有雨了”
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.12,0:50:56.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] And with no sign of any coming,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.12,0:50:56.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且没有任何要下雨的迹象
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.68,0:51:00.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Charlie had called a meeting in the onion and beetroot field,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.68,0:51:00.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}查理召集大家 在洋葱和甜菜地里开会
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.00,0:51:04.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which by now should have been showing an emerging crop.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.00,0:51:04.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这块地到现在 本来应该已经长出庄稼苗了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.56,0:51:09.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}When did we put them in? A month ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.56,0:51:09.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们什么时候种的？一个月前？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.20,0:51:11.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Charlie] Er, six and a half weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.20,0:51:11.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-那是六个半星期前了 -有六个半星期了？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.40,0:51:15.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Is it six and a half weeks? And this is all we've got so far, which is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.40,0:51:15.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}到目前为止我们只长了这些 等于什么都没长
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.56,0:51:17.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Charlie] Look, there it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.56,0:51:18.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看 在那儿呢 它们现在已经枯了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.52,0:51:19.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They've now just frazzled.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.84,0:51:21.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy sighing] Bollocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.84,0:51:21.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}妈的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.12,0:51:23.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What are we going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.12,0:51:23.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们该怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.40,0:51:27.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think, you know, particularly in these areas here,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.40,0:51:27.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得 你知道 特别是在这些区域
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.76,0:51:30.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and we can band it off, I would re-drill those bits.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.76,0:51:30.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们可以把它们隔开 我会重新播种那些地方
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.24,0:51:32.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Re-drill this. What about the onions?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.24,0:51:32.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}重新播种这块 那洋葱呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.88,0:51:34.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Charlie] Yeah, over the far side. -[Jeremy] So...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.88,0:51:34.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 在远的那边
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.64,0:51:37.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Re-plant most of this field.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.64,0:51:37.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 这块地大部分要重新种
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.00,0:51:39.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Yes. -[Jeremy] Even though...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.00,0:51:39.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-对 -但即使没有…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.32,0:51:41.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Even though there's no moisture.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.32,0:51:41.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}即使没有水分
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.96,0:51:43.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Right, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.96,0:51:43.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.12,0:51:46.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Beetroots and onions: disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.12,0:51:46.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 甜菜和洋葱完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.00,0:51:48.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Up the Swanny, lost, 'cause of the weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.00,0:51:48.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}玩完了 没了 都怪这天气
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.96,0:51:49.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Ogh.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.96,0:51:54.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[rustle]
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.80,0:51:59.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Last year it was too wet. This year it's too dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.80,0:51:59.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}去年是太湿 今年是太干
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.60,0:52:03.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy sighing] Jesus Christ...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.60,0:52:03.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.88,0:52:09.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[soft acoustic music]
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.88,0:52:14.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[upbeat music] -[goats bleating]
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.88,0:52:14.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（下集预告）
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.12,0:52:15.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy whispering] Look, there's the dog! The dog's doing it!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.12,0:52:15.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看 狗在那儿！你看 狗在赶羊！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.96,0:52:18.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] Woah... -[woman shouting] That'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.96,0:52:18.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}停下 行了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.16,0:52:20.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[ducks quacking] -[Jeremy] No no no! Oh my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.16,0:52:20.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不！天哪！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.20,0:52:23.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[cows mooing] -[Kaleb] Ey ey ey ey! Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.20,0:52:23.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天哪！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.28,0:52:25.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-This guy has travelled 8,000 miles. -What is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.28,0:52:25.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这家伙飞了一万二千多公里
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.20,0:52:27.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}A garden warbler. [laughing excitedly]
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.20,0:52:27.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-它是什么？ -庭园林莺
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.00,0:52:30.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So you were gonna do the combining this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.00,0:52:30.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 你本来打算今年自己收割的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.72,0:52:32.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We can't afford spillages.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.72,0:52:32.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们可承受不起撒漏
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.28,0:52:33.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}For God's sake, Kaleb!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.28,0:52:33.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看在上帝的份上 卡莱布！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.96,0:52:35.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Look, that's rain innit?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.96,0:52:35.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看 下雨了 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.56,0:52:36.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.56,0:52:37.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-操！ -快！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.68,0:52:37.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Go! Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.68,0:52:39.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[upbeat music continues]
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.84,0:52:41.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[crashing]
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.08,0:52:43.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Well, things can't get worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.08,0:52:43.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}情况不会更糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.92,0:52:46.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[cow mooing] -I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.92,0:52:47.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道 我有个坏消息
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.36,0:52:47.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've got bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.44,0:52:50.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[cows mooing]
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.68,0:52:54.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[upbeat music]
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.72,0:53:22.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}字幕翻译：匡思颖
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.80,0:53:24.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}创意监督 张珺怡
